<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were steady to weak, instances $0.50 lower. Demand was moderate to light. Top $52.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 50.50-51.50, some 52.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/off $2.00. Top 52.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs.  42.00-46.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs.  45.00-48.00</p>
<p>		500-600 lbs.  48.00-50.00</p>
<p>		few over 600 lbs.  50.00-51.00, few 52.00</p>
</text>
